Three citation mismatches (same failure mode as P3-0008/P3-0009, both also in this pravila/propisi sub-series): bk-pra-2-12 mislabels 122-136 GHz as secondary/not-recommended when RK p.279 shows 134.001-136 GHz is explicitly primary/recommended (real secondary range is 136-141 GHz); bk-pra-2-18's own prose cites the wrong page number for "LARU Regija 1" (says str.271, actually p.267, which the cite field itself gets right); bk-pra-2-29 claims 7040-7045 kHz is exclusively telegraphy/digital when RK p.264 (the cited page) already lists telefonija there. Work stashed: 'queue P3-0012: fail'.
